---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="ICF Level 1 (ACC) Coach Certification — Kuala Lumpur"
  description="ICF Level 1 ACC coach certification in Kuala Lumpur. 60 hours education, 10 mentor coaching hours, observed triads, real clients from week two."
>

  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-bronze-600 animate-pulse"></span>
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-bronze-600">
        In-Person Cohort · Kuala Lumpur
      </span>
    </div>
    
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-navy-900 leading-tight mb-6">
      ICF Level 1 (ACC) coach certification — Kuala Lumpur
    </h1>

    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-charcoal-900 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-8">
      Sixty hours of coach-specific education, ten hours of mentor coaching, and real clients from week two. You finish with four of ICF’s five ACC requirements already done.
    </p>

    <!-- Accreditation Explainer Inset -->
    <div class="p-8 bg-sand-50 border border-sand-200 rounded-xl mb-12">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-3">Accredited, not aligned.</h2>
      <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-charcoal-900 leading-relaxed mb-3">
        Frances’ Coaching School holds ICF Level 1 accreditation. That has one practical consequence for you: when you apply for your ACC, you use ICF’s Level 1 path — USD 175 for ICF members, reviewed in about four weeks.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-charcoal-900 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Coaches who train with a programme ICF has not accredited apply through the Portfolio path instead — USD 475 for members, reviewed in about fourteen weeks.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-charcoal-900 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Same credential. Different route to it. Ask any school you are considering which one you will be using.
      </p>
      <a href="/icf-level-1-or-portfolio-path" class="text-xs font-semibold text-navy-900 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-navy-800">
        The difference explained in full &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Stats Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
      <div class="p-6 bg-sand-50 border border-sand-200 rounded-lg">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-charcoal-900/70 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Tuition Fee</div>
        <div class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-1">RM10,900</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-charcoal-900/80">100% HRD Corp claimable via GPS Professionals Sdn Bhd.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 bg-sand-50 border border-sand-200 rounded-lg">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-charcoal-900/70 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">ICF Path Fee</div>
        <div class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-1">USD 175 / USD 325</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-charcoal-900/80">Level 1 member / non-member fee paid to ICF, not to the school.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 bg-sand-50 border border-sand-200 rounded-lg">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-charcoal-900/70 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Cohort Cap</div>
        <div class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-1">About 10</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-charcoal-900/80">Every session observed, written feedback for every student.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Primary Action -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4">
      <a 
        href="/attend-a-preview" 
        class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center px-8 py-4 bg-navy-900 hover:bg-navy-800 text-sand-50 font-semibold text-base rounded-full shadow-sm transition"
      >
        Register for the preview
      </a>
      <a 
        href="/downloads/brochure.pdf" 
        target="_blank" 
        class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center px-6 py-4 bg-sand-50 hover:bg-sand-200/80 border border-sand-200 text-charcoal-900 font-medium text-sm rounded-full transition"
      >
        Download brochure (PDF)
      </a>
    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- Pull Quote Banner -->
  <section class="py-14 bg-navy-900 text-sand-50 border-y border-navy-800 text-center px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <blockquote class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold leading-snug text-sand-50">
        “Four of the five ACC requirements are done the day you finish.”
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Programme Details & Module Map -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    
    <!-- What is covered -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-6">What is covered</h2>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-charcoal-900 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        60 hours coach-specific education. 10 mentor coaching hours — 7 group, 3 one-to-one. 12 paid client hours minimum. Five observed sessions with written feedback. Performance evaluation at ACC standard.
      </p>
      
      <!-- Module Map 3-Card Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-8">
        <div class="p-6 bg-sand-50 border border-sand-200 rounded-lg">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-bronze-600 block mb-2">Module 1</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-navy-900 mb-2">Ethics, Mindset, Agreements</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-900/80">Covering ICF Core Competencies 1, 2, and 3.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 bg-sand-50 border border-sand-200 rounded-lg">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-bronze-600 block mb-2">Module 2</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-navy-900 mb-2">Trust, Presence, Listening</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-900/80">Covering ICF Core Competencies 4, 5, and 6.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 bg-sand-50 border border-sand-200 rounded-lg">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-bronze-600 block mb-2">Module 3</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-navy-900 mb-2">Awareness, Accountability, Assessment</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-900/80">Covering ICF Core Competencies 7 and 8.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- How You Learn & Practice Clients -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb-16">
      <div class="p-8 bg-sand-50 border border-sand-200 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-4">How you learn it</h3>
        <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-charcoal-900 leading-relaxed">
          Triads, audio recordings, live mentoring, written observer feedback, real clients from week two, the workbook.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 bg-sand-50 border border-sand-200 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-4">Practice clients</h3>
        <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-charcoal-900 leading-relaxed">
          Past students coach current students. Real sessions, properly logged, not role-play. Around fifteen past students are still active.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Upcoming Cohorts & Venue -->
    <div class="p-8 md:p-10 bg-sand-200/50 border border-sand-200 rounded-xl mb-16">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-6">Upcoming Cohorts & Venue</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8 pb-8 border-b border-sand-200">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-900 block mb-1">Cohort 6</span>
          <p class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-navy-900 mb-1">14–15 August, 11–12 September, 9–10 October 2026</p>
          <span class="text-xs text-charcoal-900/70">In person, Kuala Lumpur</span>
        </div>

        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-900 block mb-1">Cohort 7</span>
          <p class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-navy-900 mb-1">13–14 November, 18–19 December 2026, 15–16 January 2027</p>
          <span class="text-xs text-charcoal-900/70">In person, Kuala Lumpur</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-base font-bold text-navy-900 mb-2">Venue</h3>
        <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-charcoal-900 leading-relaxed mb-2">
          Wealth Wolves Training Room, First Floor, H-2-9 Parklane Commercial Hub, Jalan SS7/26, Kelana Jaya, 47301 Petaling Jaya, Selangor.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-900/70">Basement parking, cashless, RM5.50 per full day.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Instructor & Record -->
    <div class="border-t border-sand-200 pt-12">
      <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-4">Instructor & Track Record</h3>
      <p class="text-base text-charcoal-900 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Dr Frances Penafort, MCC (ICF). Director of Education. First and only woman MCC in Malaysia with an ICF-accredited coaching school.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base text-charcoal-900 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Five cohorts completed. The sixth is running now. Five graduates have sat the ICF credential exam. Five have passed. Cohorts are capped at about ten, every session is observed, and every student gets written feedback. That is why the number is small, and it is why we publish it. Ask any school for theirs.
      </p>
      <a 
        href="https://coachingfederation.org" 
        target="_blank" 
        rel="noopener noreferrer" 
        class="text-xs font-semibold text-navy-900 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-navy-800"
      >
        View Dr Frances Penafort in the ICF Coach Directory &nearr;
      </a>
    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- Closing Action -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-sand-50 border-t border-sand-200 text-center px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-charcoal-900 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        The preview runs on the first Saturday of every month. Sixty minutes, no charge, and you will know by the end whether this is for you.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-4">
        <a 
          href="/attend-a-preview" 
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-navy-900 hover:bg-navy-800 text-sand-50 font-semibold text-base rounded-full shadow-sm transition"
        >
          Register for the preview
        </a>
        <a 
          href="/downloads/brochure.pdf" 
          target="_blank" 
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-4 bg-sand-100 hover:bg-sand-200/80 border border-sand-200 text-charcoal-900 font-medium text-sm rounded-full transition"
        >
          Download brochure (PDF)
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>